 "} against ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 ". It is positive for the five Platonic solids, zero for {4, 4}, {3, 6} and \
{6, 3}, and negative everywhere else."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"72e1cccc-1b1d-4421-a5ea-9ef95550c2f7"],

